[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4681.55, "timestamp": "01:18:01", "text": "他有我想要的能量枪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4685.709, "timestamp": "01:18:05", "text": "更换了护盾，但护盾并没有生效。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4689.95, "timestamp": "01:18:09", "text": "啊，莫，没关系，你玩得越多越好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4693.149, "timestamp": "01:18:13", "text": "你越进步越好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4696.229, "timestamp": "01:18:16", "text": "所以，我必相信，这是一件好事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4698.149, "timestamp": "01:18:18", "text": "就是你可以像自动CU那样在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4701.35, "timestamp": "01:18:21", "text": "就像你可以在你之后做女王一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4703.99, "timestamp": "01:18:23", "text": "再次出现，这真是个好功能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4730.39, "timestamp": "01:18:50", "text": "嗯，让我查一下比利·比利·H"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4733.669, "timestamp": "01:18:53", "text": "你知道我是什么时候开始直播的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4739.55, "timestamp": "01:18:59", "text": "[音乐]"}]